  "rationale": "All five islands have converged to effectively the same score, and recent gains are orders of magnitude below the required 1e-5. There is no meaningful evidence favoring I2 or I4 despite their larger budgets. Shift toward underexplored hybridization and reformulation, flatten parent selection, and equalize island budgets. Keep fidelity settings unchanged because the evidence indicates basin stagnation rather than inadequate evaluation time. Test multiscale microstructure and diversity-aware recombination instead of further polishing the same incumbent.",
